  String get usageAnalyticsAllowButton;

  /// First-launch sheet, under the buttons: where the choice can be changed later. 'More' is the app's second bottom tab and 'Privacy settings' a row on it; both must match those screens. Part of the versioned usage-analytics wording: changing it means bumping usageAnalyticsVersion.
  ///
  /// In en, this message translates to:
